arbeitnow:engineering-manager-server-dri:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Codeless, our internal Server-Driven UI (SDUI) platform team. In this role, you will lead a cross-functional team bridging mobile/web frontend engineering and core platform backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this role is deeply rooted in modern UI architecture, its mission goes beyond standard UI development: Codeless empowers product teams across the organization to ship dynamic, native UI experiences dynamically from the backend—eliminating app store release bottlenecks, dramatically accelerating feature iteration, and establishing a unified UI schema across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with broad impact, from hands-on technical guidance to championing web and mobile accessibility across the company. We're looking for a leader who excels at fostering collaboration and can confidently guide a concept from initial idea to robust implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform ("Codeless"). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture &amp;amp; Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the design and evolution of dynamic layout engines, declarative UI schemas, and client rendering frameworks across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Velocity &amp;amp; Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product feature teams to drive internal adoption of Codeless. Ensure the platform provides exceptional Developer Experience, clear tooling, robust design system integration, and seamless debugging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Set high technical standards for platform performance, payload optimization, caching strategies, backward compatibility, and graceful offline/fallback behavior across client devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers, Design System leaders, and Core Infrastructure engineers to align the Codeless roadmap with broader company initiatives and global design paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Management:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience managing software engineering teams, with a track record of coaching engineers, delivering complex platform initiatives, and driving technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI &amp;amp; Platform Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational background in mobile (iOS/Android) or modern web architecture (React, SwiftUI, Jetpack Compose, or declarative UI paradigms).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Platform Mindset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to treat internal product engineering teams as customers, evaluating platform success through developer velocity, adoption metrics, and rendering performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:consultant-developpeur-marketi:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world's leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="http://www.vml.com/" data-outlook-id="d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1"&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=" data-outlook-id="a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Consulting (anciennement Velvet Consulting) est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé dans la transformation de l’expérience client. Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leurs projets Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology pour leur permettre d’activer pleinement la valeur de leurs données.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au-delà de VML Consulting, VML Enterprise Solutions réunit les expertises technologiques et data de VML pour accompagner les plus grands défis business. Avec plus de 10 000 experts dans 40+ bureaux à travers le monde, nous combinons conseil, expérience client, commerce et transformation technologique. Les équipes de VML Entreprise Solutions interviennent en IA, ingénierie, data, automatisation et déploiement de plateformes, en partenariat avec les leaders du marché : Adobe, Salesforce, Google, Microsoft, Braze, pour ne citer qu’eux. VML est ainsi le 3ème intégrateur de Salesforce dans le monde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le pôle MarTech de la BU Technology &amp;amp; Digital de VML Consulting recrute pour accompagner de grands acteurs (retail, banque, assurance, luxe,..) dans l’implémentation et l’optimisation de leurs plateformes marketing et CRM. Nous recherchons un.e Consultant.e Développeur MarTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton rôle:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Consultant·e Développeur.se MarTech, tu seras au cœur des projets d’intégration et de migration de solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et maintenir les flux de données entre plateformes marketing (Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, CDP, en particulier Imagino, CRM, outils internes…) et systèmes tiers via APIs et connecteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à la mise en œuvre technique des plateformes MarTech (configuration, scripts, intégrations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser, modéliser et optimiser les pipelines de données pour garantir la fiabilité et la performance des solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer avec les équipes projet pour assurer la réussite des déploiements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monter progressivement en responsabilité vers un rôle de référent technique sur des projets MarTech complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé·e d’une école d’ingénieur ou équivalent bac+5 en Informatique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 à 5 ans d’expérience professionnelle, avec une première expérience significative en développement ou intégration de solutions data/CRM/MarTech. Une connaissance de l’univers du conseil est un vrai plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise d’une ou plusieurs compétences techniques :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Langages : HTML, SQL, JavaScript, Java, Python, ou équivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APIsation et Web Services (REST, SOAP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bases de données relationnelles et manipulation de flux de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développeur.se, tu as des bases significatives en gestion de projets et un bon background sur tout ce qui touche à la data (qualité, flux,…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es curieux·se des environnements CRM &amp;amp; Marketing Automation (Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, CDP, en particulier Imagino…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu aimes travailler en équipe et résoudre des problématiques techniques variées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es bon communicant, capable de parler aux métiers comme à l’IT, et de comprendre les enjeux business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu parles couramment anglais (clients internationaux, capacité à travailler au quotidien en anglais).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’opportunité de monter en expertise sur des technologies MarTech de référence (Adobe, Salesforce, Imagino et autres CDP leaders du marché).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement stimulant, au croisement de la tech, de la data et du marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un cabinet à taille humaine intégré dans un grand groupe (VML/ WPP), combinant agilité et perspectives internationales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement de carrière personnalisé : certifications, formations, coaching technique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture collaborative où chacun peut devenir force de proposition et évoluer rapidement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu te sens prêt.e à rejoindre l’aventure ? N’hésite pas, postule !&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="scxw176048299"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click "Submit Application", this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it's a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy"&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice"&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-lead-servicenow-itom-lo:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in New York City, Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. is a leading developer, publisher, and marketer of interactive entertainment for consumers around the globe. We develop and publish products principally through Rockstar Games, 2K, and Zynga. Our products are designed for console gaming systems, PC, and mobile, including smartphones and tablets. We deliver our products through physical retail, digital download, online platforms, and cloud streaming services. The Company’s common stock is publicly traded on NASDAQ under the symbol TTWO. For more corporate and product information please visit our website at&lt;a href="http://www.take2games.com/"&gt; http://www.take2games.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While our offices (physical and virtual) are casual and inviting, we are deeply committed to our core tenets of creativity, innovation and efficiency, and individual and team development opportunities. Our industry and business are continually evolving and fast-paced, providing numerous opportunities to learn and hone your skills. We work hard, but we also like to have fun, and believe that we provide a great place to come to work each day to pursue your passions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE CHALLENGE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a seasoned &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow IT Operations Implementation Specialist, &lt;/strong&gt;you will execute our evolving Configuration Management Database (CMDB) strategy, governance, and infrastructure roadmap. You will build a foundational system from the ground up, engaging with CMDB product and data owners to navigate diverse viewpoints, establish clear standards, and foster a culture of data integrity. Your work will empower the organization with accurate, actionable insights into technology assets within a fast-paced, creative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL TAKE ON&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the implementation of CMDB and CSDM strategies, including the definition of CI classes, attributes, dependencies, and service mapping approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configure &amp;amp; Customize:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the end-to-end lifecycle of ServiceNow Discovery and Service Mapping, including MID servers, network/security settings, probes, patterns, and schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrate &amp;amp; Automate:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain integrations via IntegrationHub, Service Graph Connectors, and scripted REST/SOAP APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and implement high-impact opportunities for embedding GenAI and Agentic Workflows into IT Operations for alert analysis, remediation, and data anomaly detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee CMDB health maintenance, data normalization, and reconciliation processes to ensure a "self-healing" IT environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a bridge between technical infrastructure and business stakeholders to translate complex operational challenges into scalable, AI-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep technical proficiency in the ServiceNow platform, including base system data structures and ITOM Visibility solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skillset: &lt;/strong&gt;Advanced JavaScript, GlideRecord, GlideAjax, PowerShell, Business Rules, and Flow Designer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level knowledge of Discovery patterns, credentials, and error handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of ITSM, ITAM, VR, and ITIL (specifically CI and asset lifecycle management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP), virtualization (hypervisors, containerization), and Infrastructure as Code (IaC).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in data analysis, reporting, and complex data quality governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional interpersonal and leadership skills with a track record of driving consensus across diverse teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emerging Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience integrating AI/ML-assisted features and Agentic Workflows to enhance team productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great Company Culture&lt;/strong&gt;. We pride ourselves as being one of the most creative and innovative places to work, creativity, innovation, efficiency, diversity and philanthropy are among the core tenets of our organization and are integral drivers of our continued success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: As a global entertainment company, we pride ourselves on creating environments where employees are encouraged to be themselves, inquisitive, collaborative and to grow within and around the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Play Hard.&lt;/strong&gt; Our employees’ bond, blow-off steam, and flex some creative muscles – through corporate boot camp classes, our onsite Gym, company parties, our Office bar, game release events, monthly socials, and team challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;. Include, but aren't limited to, private medical and dental insurance, virtual GP, a health cash plan for preventative medical costs, matching pension policy up to 4%, a workplace savings scheme for short-term savings, £50 monthly fitness reimbursement, 24/7 mental wellbeing support, family building and menopause support, an Employee Stock Purchase Plan with 15% discount, Cycle to Work scheme, 4x salary death in service insurance, 66% of salary income protection, charitable donation matching and volunteer leave, 26 days of annual leave, and enhanced family policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks&lt;/strong&gt;. Onsite Gym, an office bar, employee discount programs, free games and events, stocked pantries, and a dog friendly workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware that Take-Two does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others. Take-Two also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and the Company will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel. Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scam or phishing exercise. Take-Two’s in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a take2games.com email domain). If you need to report an issue or otherwise have questions, please contact -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. (“Take-Two”) is committed to fostering and celebrating the diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds of its talent, partners, and communities throughout its organization. Consistent with this commitment, Take-Two does not discriminate or retaliate against any employee or job applicant because of their race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, sexual orientation, and gender identity), national origin, age, disability, and genetic information (including family medical history), or on the basis of any other trait protected by applicable law. If you need to report a concern or have questions regarding Take-Two’s equal opportunity commitment, please contact -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node="17"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:lead-account-executive-central:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;div class="elementToProof"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead at the forefront of AI &amp;amp; Data Resilience&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Veeam, we don’t just talk about the future of technology — we are actively shaping it. We are a global leader in data resilience, operating at the epicentre of the AI, cloud and security evolution. Our culture is built by forward-thinking technologists with heart: people who challenge convention, collaborate openly, and believe that great ideas can come from anywhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Veeam means being part of a business that combines the energy and agility of a start-up with the scale, credibility, and market leadership of a global technology powerhouse. We focus relentlessly on customer outcomes, empower our teams to own their destiny, and create an inclusive environment where every voice matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Veeam&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work at the heart of AI-driven data resilience, enjoy flexibility and outcome-based performance, and lead with autonomy in a globally recognized organization that invests deeply in its people, culture, and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pivotal growth role within Veeam’s UK &amp;amp; Ireland organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Lead Account Executive, Enterprise you will be responsible for a book of existing key customers in the Central Gov &amp;amp; Blue Light accounts and a set of target enterprise accounts to hunt and close net new logo acquisition. You will drive a daily rhythm to ensure in quarter execution and build forward pipeline. You will develop a clear point of view on the market and a constant curiosity to link corporate objectives and technology initiatives with customer and partners alike. You will set and manage the strategy for your Territory working with specialist teams in the UK &amp;amp; Ireland and Inside Sales and Sales Development teams based in Bucharest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of Enterprise, UK &amp;amp; Ireland, you will play a central role in shaping how Veeam engages customers, partners, and the market — accelerating growth while building a culture of excellence, collaboration, and innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision for your UK &amp;amp; Ireland Enterprise Territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate virtual, geographically distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive disciplined sales execution across the full Veeam portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate growth in hybrid cloud and cloud-native environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level relationships with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge the status quo with bold, innovative ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Channel, Hyperscalers, and System Integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustained revenue growth and increased wallet share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational excellence and predictable execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-trust, high-performance sales culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, long-term customer and partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A future-ready, scalable Enterprise Territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a seasoned Enterprise Sales Account Manager with presence, energy, and ambition. You bring a proven track record of leading go-to-market strategy and execution in complex technology environments, deep understanding of data resilience and cloud ecosystems, and an inspirational style to coordinate and excite virtual teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in business or technical discipline (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding quota and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in enterprise software, SaaS, or cloud organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental, and vision insurance with dependent enrolment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage and global 24/7 protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection after 26 weeks, covering a portion of salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined contribution pension plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worldwide travel insurance for business and leisure, with option to enroll dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program with therapy, legal, and financial support, plus online GP services and wellbeing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If an applicant is permanently located outside of the United Kingdom, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice="1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]" data-en-clipboard="true"&gt;
