&lt;p class="p1"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone's perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp's future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="p1"&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
